Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Y 'all move!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.85,0:01:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.43,0:01:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,My Egyptian God card was buried deep in my
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.21,0:01:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,deck until your magic card brought it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.43,0:01:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And now Slifer the Sky\NDragon is in my hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.69,0:01:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,waiting to be summoned to the\Nfield so it can destroy you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.91,0:01:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It may be in his possession for now,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.69,0:01:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,but eventually all three Egyptian\NGod cards will belong to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.03,0:01:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And speaking of Egyptian gods,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.39,0:01:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,my Obelisk the Tormenter\Nwill be free to grace
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.39,0:01:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,this duel with its\Npresence in two more turns,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.47,0:01:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,just as soon as Yugi's\NLight Force Sword wears off.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.85,0:01:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,In the meantime,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.09,0:01:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll use my XY Dragon Cannon to\Ndestroy every one of Yugi's monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.83,0:01:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,So he'll never get the three monsters he
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.35,0:01:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,needs to sacrifice in\Norder to summon Slifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.87,0:01:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I, on the other hand, will be ready to call\NObelisk to the field to finish Yugi off.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.67,0:01:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in a tough spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.13,0:02:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The good news is, I was able to get\NSlifer the Sky Dragon into my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.83,0:02:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The bad news is, I had to use my Exchange\NMagic card, which helped Kaiba also.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.43,0:02:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It allowed him to pick any\Ncard he wanted from my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.87,0:02:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And he chose my Life Shaver card.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.71,0:02:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Kaiba's holding a\Nreally dangerous trap card.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.09,0:02:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,When he plays it,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.31,0:02:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,depending on how many turns it\Nstays face down on the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.27,0:02:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I could have to discard most of my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.13,0:02:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That would give Kaiba a serious advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.69,0:02:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Since Slipers' attack points depend\Non how many cards I'm holding,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.53,0:02:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,if he wipes out my hand, my\NEgyptian God card will be worthless.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.63,0:02:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, are you gonna stand there\Ncontemplating your next move all day?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.91,0:02:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting bored, and so are my fans.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.23,0:02:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.73,0:02:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Big Shield\NGardner in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.39,0:02:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I shall place one card face down
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.91,0:03:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That ends my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.49,0:03:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,My big shield gardener should hold\Noff his XY dragon. At least for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.19,0:03:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That move seemed pretty desperate to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.59,0:03:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi All the defensive monsters\Nin the world can't save you now
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.61,0:03:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I must say this duel seems\Nquite hopeless for the Pharaoh
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.81,0:03:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon Kaiba will be free to\Nunleash Obelisk the Tormenter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.85,0:03:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And unless the Pharaoh can bring\Nforth Slypa the Sky Dragon,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.19,0:03:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,he'll be crushed by Obelisk's\Nmighty fist of fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.81,0:03:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And even if he is lucky enough to out-duel\NKaiba, the Pharaoh will have to face me,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.57,0:03:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,giving me the pleasure of\Nbeating his soul to the shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.99,0:03:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stand waiting like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.55,0:03:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.15,0:03:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity, but Joey needs help.\NAnd I promise you he's gonna
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.95,0:03:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Get it? Tristan and Mokuba\Nare working on it now? Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.97,0:04:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,but if they've been gone this long,\NI'm sure something's wrong Duke,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.83,0:04:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,you're not helping You mean you don't think\Nan emergency chopper's on the way, Duke?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.37,0:04:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.53,0:04:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,poor Joey Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.53,0:04:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,He's in bad shape. I mean, don't\Nworry. He'll be on his feet in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.69,0:04:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Duke's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.83,0:04:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We just have to have a little\Nbit of faith, Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.47,0:04:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.41,0:04:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.07,0:04:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I just hope Yugi's okay out there, because\Nright now, it seems like no one's safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.53,0:04:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The state championship continues\Nwith Joey Wheeler in the lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.45,0:04:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, this is just the card I needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.47,0:04:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for me to summon Axe\NRaider in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.11,0:04:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dragon's history.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.71,0:04:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Do your thing, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.07,0:05:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you have zero life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.77,0:05:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Zilch, Zipo, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.23,0:05:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, man, no fair. Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.05,0:05:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm kicking some serious can.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.31,0:05:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Tristan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.75,0:05:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, uh, Yugi. They're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.07,0:05:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.47,0:05:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like those guys to just\Nwalk out on me during a duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.21,0:05:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, where's the love? Guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.39,0:05:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, now this dream\Nis starting to creep me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.49,0:05:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.39,0:05:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Kybercraft 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.27,0:05:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Come in, please, come in!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.31,0:05:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Still no dice?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.69,0:05:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.33,0:05:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't it be faster\Nto just fix our engine?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.53,0:05:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The crew's working on that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.47,0:05:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But it looks like the\Nengine's in bad shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.57,0:05:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey can't wait that long.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.73,0:06:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Odeon, I wish you were awake\Nto witness this moment with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.05,0:06:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The pharaoh's ancient struggle\Nis playing itself out once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.73,0:06:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Five thousand years after\Nthe conflict first began.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.29,0:06:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Odeon, everything's happening just\Nas the ancient scriptures predicted.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.05,0:06:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Closely examine this artifact.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.41,0:06:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the pharaoh, but that's Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.95,0:06:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And the monster carved above\Nhim is the dark magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.95,0:06:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,On the left is the sorcerer\Nfighting against him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.41,0:06:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That's you, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.63,0:06:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,If you still have any\Ndoubt, look at his monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.05,0:06:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the blue-eyes white dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.29,0:06:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The hieroglyphics read\Nthat the mighty sorcerer
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.73,0:06:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,marched into the pharaoh's\Nchamber and challenged
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.35,0:06:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,him and his legion of noble magicians to a
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.61,0:06:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,legendary duel with the\Nfate of the world at stake.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.63,0:06:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Now are you convinced, Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.53,0:07:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,As I said before, history is\Ndestined to repeat itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.91,0:07:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not just coincidence that\NYugi is your greatest opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.19,0:07:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You two have battled in the ancient past.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.47,0:07:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the lecture.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.03,0:07:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But I make my own destiny,\Nand I do what I want to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.29,0:07:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.61,0:07:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.29,0:07:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Look closely and you'll see the most\Npowerful creatures in Duel Monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.51,0:07:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Obelisk the Tormentor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.55,0:07:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Slifer the Sky Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.65,0:07:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The Winged Dragon of Ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.95,0:07:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Control one and you can\Ndestroy a million armies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.05,0:07:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Wield all three and the planet\Nitself will quake in fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.51,0:07:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And Pegasus turned them into cards?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.29,0:07:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. You lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.47,0:07:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,If he had them, why didn't\Nhe use them against me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.27,0:07:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Because Pegasus feared the power\Nof these Egyptian God Cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.91,0:07:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You cannot fathom the magical\Nenergy contained within.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.79,0:07:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus could not control the\Npower of the cards he created.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.15,0:07:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,They threatened to\Noverwhelm and destroy him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.93,0:08:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a gift for you, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.01,0:08:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it. Hmm? Can it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.75,0:08:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Obelisk the Tormentor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.05,0:08:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.96,0:08:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The only Egyptian God Card that\Nwasn't stolen by rare hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.67,0:08:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You may borrow this card for your\Ntournament, but I expect it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.61,0:08:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not every day a card\Nthis rare is handed to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.81,0:08:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What if I chose to keep it forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.27,0:08:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What makes you think I can be trusted?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.67,0:08:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I could walk out and\Nyou'd never see it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.49,0:08:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You will return the card to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.87,0:08:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It is Yugi and Kaiba's\Nconnection to the ancient past.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.29,0:08:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,that allows them each to\Nwield an Egyptian god card.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.11,0:08:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,However, the outcome of this\Nancient feud is still uncertain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.19,0:08:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,For nowhere is it written\Nhow the conflict between the
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.35,0:08:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,great pharaoh and the mystical\Nsorcerer finally ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.13,0:08:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No one living today knows which one of\Nthese two ancient leaders was victorious.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.61,0:08:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So all I can do at this time is wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.09,0:09:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And hope that light will\Nshine once again and
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.29,0:09:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,mankind will be saved from\Nthe impending darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.05,0:09:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba! Kaiba! Kaiba! Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.29,0:09:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like I've got you\Nbacked into a corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.19,0:09:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks can be deceiving.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.99,0:09:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Now make your move.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.37,0:09:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your hurry?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.65,0:09:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Anxious to lose?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.15,0:09:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Suit yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.69,0:09:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.75,0:09:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This is exactly what I needed to complete\Nmy strategy and Yugi's Annihilation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.27,0:09:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I place one card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.65,0:09:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll bet Kaiba just played the Life\NShaver Trap card he got from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.61,0:09:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,And the worst part comes now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.25,0:09:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The worst part for you, that is!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.55,0:09:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Z-Metal Tank in attack mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.03,0:09:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the final creature I needed to\Ncomplete my ultimate machine monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.39,0:09:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Now my beast will be unstoppable!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.57,0:10:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Just watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.95,0:10:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold my XYZ Dragon Cannon
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.89,0:10:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Most impressive, Kaiba. Now I can see\Nhow you were able to defeat my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.21,0:10:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Say farewell to your big shield,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.01,0:10:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Gardner Now XYZ Dragon\NCannon, attack his monster
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.01,0:10:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,that's one monster down\Nand one to go then i can
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.49,0:10:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,sacrifice my dragon cannon\Nto unleash the fury of my
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.87,0:10:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,egyptian god card thank you\Ndestroying one of my defensive
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.17,0:10:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,monsters is exactly what\Ni was hoping you would do,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.27,0:10:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.18,0:10:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Why's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.27,0:11:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you allowed me to play this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.03,0:11:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold, I reveal my face\Ndown card, Soul of Trap. Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.23,0:11:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,At a cost of 1,000 of my life points,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.39,0:11:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,this card allows me to summon\Nany four-star monster directly
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.79,0:11:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,to the field whenever one of\Nmy creatures is destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.99,0:11:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And I choose King's Knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.39,0:11:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Observe, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.47,0:11:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I have both King's and Queen's\NKnight. It's not possible. Both cards?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.19,0:11:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. Which means I can\Nnow summon Jack's Knight to the
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.09,0:11:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,field Then you'll have three monsters\NI see you're paying attention,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.95,0:11:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyra, I'll soon have\Nexactly what I need to
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.03,0:11:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Summon my Egyptian god card.\NJack's Knight, come forth.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.59,0:11:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you, I now have\Nthree monsters to sacrifice
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.99,0:12:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't play your Egyptian God\Ncard before I play mine. I've
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.77,0:12:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,been in control of this duel from\Nthe start Not anymore And now,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.25,0:12:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I sacrifice all three of\Nmy monsters Be gone, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.11,0:12:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And next, I summon my Egyptian\Ngod guard, Slifer the Sky Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.05,0:12:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Stare into the face of defeat, Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.31,0:12:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.13,0:12:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.67,0:13:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Summoned by the hand of the pharaoh,\Nthe first Egyptian god has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.37,0:13:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,How unexpected!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.67,0:13:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The pharaoh brought forth Slypha\Nbefore Kaiba summoned Obelisk!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.03,0:13:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not impressed, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.75,0:13:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.37,0:13:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I managed to summon one of Duel\NMonster's most powerful creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.23,0:13:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, that may be, but it\Ndoes have its weaknesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.67,0:13:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,For instance,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.65,0:13:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Slifer the Sky Dragon's\Nattack points are equal to 1
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.81,0:13:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,,000 times the number of cards\Nyou're holding in your hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.03,0:13:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuge.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.11,0:13:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And I count three, giving your\NEgyptian God card only 3,000 points!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.69,0:13:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, which makes it 200 attack\Npoints stronger than your XYZ Dragon Cannon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.67,0:13:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,So I can eliminate your cannon right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.81,0:13:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,leaving you without a single monster,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.69,0:13:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,and preventing you from\Nsummoning your God Card.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.67,0:13:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're so sure, then attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.43,0:13:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,He's definitely up to something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.15,0:14:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba seems pretty confident\Nthat his XYZ Dragon
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.81,0:14:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Cannon can survive an attack\Nby my Egyptian God Card.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.87,0:14:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,But his monster only has 2,800 attack\Npoints, and my Slifer has 3,000!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.11,0:14:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet I was right, and his face-down card\Nis the life-shaper trap he took from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.47,0:14:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Since it's been on the field for one turn,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.01,0:14:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba can use it to eliminate\None card from my hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.05,0:14:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And since my Slifer's attack points\Ndepend on how many cards I'm holding,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.91,0:14:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,it'll go down to 2,000, making\Nit weaker than Kaiba's monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.51,0:14:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The Pharaoh may have summoned an Egyptian\Ngod, but he seems hesitant to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.59,0:14:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba has him questioning his\Nstrategy with just one face-down card.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.31,0:14:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you realize you're going to lose\Nwhether you attack me or not, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.23,0:14:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,If I don't attack Kaiba right now, he'll\Nsacrifice his monster and summon Obelisk.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.11,0:14:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But if I do, he could destroy my Slifer,\Nand without it, I'll never win this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.97,0:14:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.85,0:15:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.43,0:15:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the pressure getting to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.33,0:15:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, it doesn't matter\Nif you attack me or not!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.97,0:15:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, I've got you beat,\Nthanks to my face-down card!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.91,0:15:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,So go ahead and make your move!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.45,0:15:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should just play\Nit safe and end my turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.97,0:15:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I can't back down!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.71,0:15:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Sniper, attack his monster now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.35,0:15:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It's showtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.07,0:15:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.11,0:15:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a good look at my face down card.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.15,0:15:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not life, Shaver.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.09,0:15:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.15,0:15:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's called Interdimensional\NMatter Transporter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.11,0:15:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Just watch what it can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.71,0:16:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like something\Nmajor's going on up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.59,0:16:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Odeon, Slifer has just attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.97,0:16:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that flash of light?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.51,0:16:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not so sure, but our\Ntransmission signal is stronger now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.81,0:16:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Kaiba Corp\Nheadquarters responding, over.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.13,0:16:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We received your distress\Nsignal and an emergency
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.09,0:16:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,helicopter is being dispatched\Nmomentarily. Oh, yeah! It worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.89,0:16:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Copter 1, cleared for takeoff.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.55,0:16:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Set your course for Kaivakorp Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.55,0:16:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's on its way right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.65,0:16:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's gonna get help.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.99,0:16:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go tell Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.55,0:16:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if I can transmit video.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.41,0:16:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess it's worth a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.77,0:16:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like I can watch Seto's duel now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.69,0:16:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And so can the entire city.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.55,0:17:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You see what I see?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.83,0:17:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.31,0:17:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at the monster, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.73,0:17:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that must be a duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.79,0:17:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to your cannon, Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.67,0:17:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.11,0:17:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,My trap card was able to take\Nit out of play for one turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.19,0:17:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Very clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.57,0:17:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like your plan to save\Nyour monster from my attack worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.71,0:17:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I've also got a plan,\Nso I'll play this face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.77,0:17:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Now go ahead and make\Nyour move, if you dare.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.57,0:17:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.01,0:17:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I confuse you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.85,0:17:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi just lowered his monster's attack\Npoints by playing a card from his hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.71,0:17:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would he intentionally\Nweaken his own monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.27,0:17:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.63,0:17:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It sounds like your adoring fans are\Neagerly waiting for you to make a decision,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.33,0:17:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.24,0:17:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Slifer is weaker than your monster now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.33,0:17:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your point?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.99,0:17:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm wide open.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.51,0:18:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You can attack me with\Nyour cannon, right, Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.91,0:18:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless you're afraid to attack. Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.67,0:18:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Your scare tactics won't work,\Nbecause I know what I have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.19,0:18:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The time has come,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.63,0:18:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,and your time's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.59,0:18:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Light Force sword is no longer in\Neffect, so my Egyptian god card is free now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.37,0:18:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you know what's next.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.47,0:18:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I sacrifice my XYZ Dragon Cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.67,0:18:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,So I can summon this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.51,0:18:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Come forth now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.67,0:18:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Obelisk the Tormentor!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.05,0:18:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Use your infinite power\Nto bring me victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.03,0:18:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.93,0:18:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.61,0:18:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Look closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.83,0:19:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Here it comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.29,0:19:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,My mighty Egyptian god\Ncard is here at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.27,0:19:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The battle of the gods has begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.57,0:19:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,But which one will prevail?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.37,0:19:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope I can hold my own\Nagainst the power of Obelisk!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.39,0:19:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's definitely not going to be easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.99,0:19:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,He's twice as strong as my slifer!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.23,0:19:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, the Egyptian gods\Nare about to clash!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.25,0:19:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,But only one monster will remain standing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.89,0:19:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's time to find out which one!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.07,0:19:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.79,0:20:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha-ha!
